WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Supplier quotes need the same specification, quantity, delivery, tax and included service to be comparable.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
A $90 part with $40 shipping is not cheaper than a $115 delivered quote on the same quantity basis.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Quote audit

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
These are teaching relationships, not live prices, quotes, tax advice or a forecast. State every assumption.

